  "display_title": "Fake Love for a Week",
  "description": "A one week romance with a guy you’ve never ever thought of before!\n\nChan-U's friend, who had implied that Chan-U was incapable of holding hands with a man, bets that he wouldn’t be able to date a man for a week. Angry at his provocation, Chan-U accepts the bet in the spur of the moment.\n\nChan-U's friend then points to Eun-Ho and asks him to date him for a week. However, Chan-U, who has a guilty conscience, decides to disclose the bet to Eun-Ho.\n“I would like to be part of that bet too.”\n\"W-what?\"\nShould we… date for a week?\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
